WEBVTT

00:05:58.813 --> 00:06:00.314
We have fun.

00:06:01.023 --> 00:06:02.775
And that doesn't just feel good,

00:06:02.775 --> 00:06:04.819
it is good for us.

00:06:04.819 --> 00:06:07.488
In fact, fun does so many
amazingly good things for us

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:11.617
that I personally believe that fun is not
just the result of human thriving,

00:06:11.659 --> 00:06:12.827
it's a cause.

00:06:13.577 --> 00:06:16.205
So, for example, fun is energizing.

00:06:17.081 --> 00:06:20.251
When people tell me their stories
about fun, they glow.

00:06:20.251 --> 00:06:22.628
It is like a fire has been lit
inside of them,

00:06:22.628 --> 00:06:26.048
and the energy and the warmth
that they give off is contagious.

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:27.842
You know, so much of life drains us,

00:06:27.842 --> 00:06:29.468
but fun fills us up.